ale_record_index":"189630","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1534433004:0":{"text":"보물상자! 기쁜 마음으로 달려가던 찰나...","source_cn":"宝箱！就在你满心欢喜地奔向它时，忽然——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x855FFCD1E5C3860E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1534433005:0":{"text":"풍덩! 차가운 시냇물이 순식간에 나를 집어삼켰다...","source_cn":"扑通！冰冷的溪水瞬间淹没了你……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x257326CAFD671DD7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1534433006:0":{"text":"누군가 물에 빠졌어. 얼른 구해야 해!","source_cn":"有人掉在水里了，快来救人啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x42184C4D88E370B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1534433007:0":{"text":"저기요, 정신 차려요! 괜찮아요?","source_cn":"醒醒！快醒醒，你还好吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x80F2E500178D37A7","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"저기요, 정신 차려요! 괜찮아요?","female":"저기요, 정신 차려요! 괜찮아요?","variant_male_record_index":"189635","variant_female_record_index":"189636","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:12:1534433007":{"text":"저기요, 정신 차려요! 괜찮아요?","source_cn":"醒醒！快醒醒，你还好吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x80F2E500178D37A7","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"저기요, 정신 차려요! 괜찮아요?","female":"저기요, 정신 차려요! 괜찮아요?","variant_male_record_i